canvas 520 280
label "Bounded contexts: Knowledge feeds Composition, Distribution (highlighted) and Interchange; Governance feeds Distribution; the Boundary context wraps cross-origin access, peers, declared surfaces and visibility around everything that faces outside"
caption "The highlighted Distribution context renders what Knowledge validated and adds nothing; the Boundary is the layer that keeps external drafts from moving the core."
box k 16 60 140 60 "Knowledge|items, links, graph"
box g 16 170 140 60 "Governance|prov, gates, ledger"
box i 190 20 140 50 "Interchange|import, export"
box c 190 90 140 60 "Composition|closure, Harness"
box d 190 170 140 60 "Distribution|routes, surfaces" acc
region b 350 20 154 230 "Boundary"
box b1 362 40 130 40 "cross-origin"
box b2 362 90 130 40 "peers, walk"
box b3 362 140 130 40 "declared surfaces"
box b4 362 190 130 40 "visibility, retire"
arrow k c
arrow k d
arrow g d
arrow k i
arrow d b
note "Knowledge decides, Distribution renders, Boundary keeps the outside outside"
